        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare X-linked genetic condition due to deficiency of the lysosomal-associated membrane protein 2 (LAMP2) characterized by severe cardiomyopathy and variable degrees of muscle weakness frequently associated with intellectual deficits (in males)."
        },
